"A whole note lasts four beats in 4/4.": "3ee63277d5c2",
"An eighth note has one flag on its stem.": "42cd78f23a5f",
"Count one beat for the rest, and do not play.": "2fad4ba72d64",
"Each bar of this song has four beats.": "fbd27b4f5984",
"How long is a quarter note in seconds? It depends on the tempo. A note value is relative. At 60 beats per minute, a quarter note lasts one second. At 120 beats per minute, it lasts half a second. In music we count beats, and a quarter note is one beat when the bottom number of the time signature is 4. So a half note gets two beats, and a whole note gets four.": "c761097e359f",
"How many eighth notes fit in one half note?": "17bcc0e9dcce",
